sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Browser
    participant Server as HTTPS server
    participant Root as OS / browser trust store
    Client->>Server: ClientHello (versions, key share, SNI)
    Server-->>Client: ServerHello + certificate chain
    Client->>Client: Check validity, SAN hostname, signatures, usage
    Client->>Root: Is chain anchored in a trusted root?
    Root-->>Client: Trusted / not trusted
    alt Checks succeed
        Client->>Server: Finish key agreement and establish a secure channel
        Client->>Server: Encrypted HTTP request
        Server-->>Client: Encrypted HTTP response
    else Certificate warning
        Client->>Client: Stop and report mismatch, expiry or untrusted issuer
    end
